## Behavior preservation notes

No intentional changes to:

```text
initModel()
ensureModelReady()
prompt()
cancelPrompt()
resetSession()
resetModel()
shutdownRuntime()
scheduler behavior
worker lifecycle/replacement
worker operation serialization
config override validation
retry/profile planning
stream shaping
prompt/output semantics
model identity/path policy
```

No worker-thread hard-kill behavior was introduced.

`timeoutAction` remains restricted to:

```text
mark-unhealthy
```

